phiOS design tokens — variant ${PHI_VARIANT}

  Rendered from design/preview.tmpl. Nothing installs this file and no
  application reads it: it exists so that every token has one consumer
  that is guaranteed to exercise it, and so that the two variants can be
  diffed against each other with a command rather than by eye.

  A token that is missing from a variant renders as an empty value here,
  which is the cheapest way to catch a palette that has drifted out of
  parity with the other one.


